<title>JAPAN: Icom - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Icom - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.94		vs	    7.55</p>
<p> Operating    prft 56 million	 vs   loss 414 million</p>
<p> Current     prft 116 million	 vs   loss 122 million</p>
<p> Net	    prft 92 million	 vs   loss 157 million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 6.20 yen	  vs    loss 10.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares		15 million	 vs	   15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Icom Inc is a specialised maker of wireless communications equipment.</p>
